  "statement": {
    "content": "من الكتاب (ص 38): $D = (x - \\sqrt{2})(4x + 3) - (x + 2)(x - \\sqrt{2})$ و $E = (2 - 5x)\\left(x - \\dfrac{2}{3}\\right) + (2 - 5x)\\left(x - \\dfrac{4}{3}\\right)$ ."
  },
